 "summary": [
  {
   "_key": "en",
   "_type": "internationalizedArrayStringValue",
   "value": "From Canada, aim for at least ten days, ideally twelve to fourteen: the flight alone uses a big chunk of time, and seven days pushes you to rush. The tours here run ten to fourteen days, private on any date, or as a small-group departure planned for travellers from the USA and Canada."
